          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Google Cloud revenues consist of revenues from:",
        "text_hash": "96c0700f8f00f9a7f68846f1183be30b1f00809438402cbb3ec3dc211b9deecb",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000128-aa97da5a",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/ix:continuation[2]/ix:continuation/div[13]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 128,
        "reported_page": 11,
        "source_anchor": "ia40864d152924657ba8b5e665d6b0518_37",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Google Cloud Platform primarily generates consumption-based fees and subscriptions for infrastructure, platform, and other services. These services provide access to solutions such as artificial intelligence (AI) offerings including our enterprise AI infrastructure, Vertex AI platform, and Gemini Enterprise; cybersecurity offerings; and data and analytics solutions.",
        "text_hash": "aa97da5a6c2178d9b533b0cd2071e5176e51234239ccdc70c7e936e7c7ea4815",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000129-d23aecf2",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/ix:continuation[2]/ix:continuation/div[14]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 129,
        "reported_page": 11,
        "source_anchor": "ia40864d152924657ba8b5e665d6b0518_37",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Google Workspace includes subscriptions for cloud-based communication and collaboration tools for enterprises, such as Gmail, Docs, Calendar, Drive, and Meet, with integrated features like Gemini for Google Workspace.",
        "text_hash": "d23aecf2f4124ec0f3d688fbcb4924d970478997ac2d9446b4e6d1022933ca73",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000130-abd62671",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/ix:continuation[2]/ix:continuation/div[15]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 130,
        "reported_page": 11,
        "source_anchor": "ia40864d152924657ba8b5e665d6b0518_37",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Product sales, primarily the sale of TPU systems.",
        "text_hash": "abd626714ed64a7c1c776f44c376774d15c67134aec9003bdf85092f9c1bfd11",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
